        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"51fb3544-5d75-430a-95e7-99f94beeb3e5\",\"review_text\":\"There's a lot of ads for phone\"},{\"review_id\":\"798f6c1c-9292-4c4b-9f7b-7dc040ac68d0\",\"review_text\":\"Well, everybody knows this, but this is undoubtedly the best music app out there. U can get, literally, every other music ever created here. Everybody should have a spotify 😀🤗🤗\"},{\"review_id\":\"62a8a675-1293-4090-a775-2d48ca8cafdc\",\"review_text\":\"There's no other way to get rid of of the shuffle and it's really annoying I tried so many things and also now I can't play the song I just want to listen to music while doing something old spotiffy put on settings turn off shuffle\"},{\"review_id\":\"ec82573c-2098-4292-a17b-4690612181a1\",\"review_text\":\"Worst music app ever\"},{\"review_id\":\"92ad4235-6ff5-48ff-b315-5f1af73b88ed\",\"review_text\":\"So goood but the adds ar anoying\"},{\"review_id\":\"a0164fc6-572f-48ad-9b64-81cf714a7199\",\"review_text\":\"Good app i love bts txt black pink\"},{\"review_id\":\"2b806b2d-3e51-42b4-8798-2114fd3ca072\",\"review_text\":\"It is a very good app for all type of song and lyrics.you can hear your favourite song and enjoy it\"},{\"review_id\":\"2103fbf6-1d50-4fbf-99a4-90d05442e625\",\"review_text\":\"Nice and it recommend very good playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"a5428857-50ac-407d-819a-ac52a781ebb8\",\"review_text\":\"The great way to chill\"},{\"review_id\":\"66631037-c91b-441a-8bcd-24389c6a285f\",\"review_text\":\"I enjoy the selection and the podcasts as a truck driver I listen a lot. The bad score is because I can't turn off autoplay. As soon as my phone connects the app turns on and starts playing and I will end up deleting the app if not fixed.\"}]}"
